### Also add a `.gitignore`

Create this file in the **root** of `NoteGen-AI`:

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo

# Virtual environment
venv/
env/
.venv/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Node
node_modules/
frontend/dist/

# Environment
.env
.env.*

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs
*.log

# Generated training files
data/processed/*.pt

# Python build
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/